<view class="page-stack generation-page">
  <view class="page-header generation-header">
    <view>
      <text class="overline">PROJECT SYNTHESIS · B46–B80</text>
      <view>多语言项目生成</view>
      <view>输入简述，或导入 TXT、Markdown、Word、HTML、PDF、能力模块与在线 HTML，一键生成可运行工程、验证证据、本地部署和云端部署手册。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="generation-header-status">
      <StatusChip status="{{draft ? &quot;REVIEW&quot; : &quot;DRAFT&quot;}}" />
      <StatusChip status="{{job?.status ?? &quot;NOT_RUN&quot;}}" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="metric-grid metric-grid-four" aria-label="项目生成能力摘要">
    <view class="metric-card">
      <text>项目合成功能</text>
      <text>{{capability?.projectSkillCount ?? 417}}</text>
      <text>结构化生成能力</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric-card">
      <text>精确目标栈</text>
      <text>{{capability?.targets.length ?? generationTargets.length}}</text>
      <text>8 个独立 emitter / verifier</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric-card">
      <text>已选目标</text>
      <text>{{selectedProfiles.length}}</text>
      <text>一个意图，多份独立工程</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric-card">
      <text>本地 Runner</text>
      <text class="{{`metric-word ${runnerReady ? &quot;&quot; : &quot;warning-text&quot;}`}}">{{runnerReady ? "READY" : runnerReadiness?.status ?? "CHECKING"}}</text>
      <text>{{runnerReadiness?.isolation ?? capability?.localRunner.isolation ?? "NOT_CONFIGURED"}} · 持久恢复</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="source-notice generation-notice" role="{{capabilityError ? &quot;alert&quot; : &quot;status&quot;}}">
    <Icon name="lock" size="{{16}}" />
    <text>{{capabilityError || runnerReasonMessage(runnerReadiness?.reason) || capability?.note || "正在读取仓库内 Project Synthesis 契约与本地 Runner 状态。"}}</text>
    <StatusChip status="{{capabilityError || runnerReadiness?.status === &quot;BLOCKED&quot; ? &quot;BLOCKED&quot; : capability?.source ?? &quot;REPOSITORY_CONTRACT&quot;}}" compact="true" />
  </view>
  <view class="generation-layout">
    <form class="surface-card generation-form" aria-labelledby="generation-form-title" bindsubmit="createDraft">
      <view class="generation-section-heading">
        <view>
          <text class="overline">PROJECT INTENT</text>
          <view id="generation-form-title">描述并审阅项目意图</view>
        </view>
        <text class="step-label">01 / 02</text>
      </view>
      <view class="generation-fields">
        <text class="generation-field"><text>项目名称</text> <input value="{{name}}" required="true" pattern="{{&quot;[a-z][a-z0-9\\-]{1,62}[a-z0-9]&quot;}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="project-name-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="project-name-hint">小写字母、数字与连字符，例如 order-service</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field"><text>命名空间</text> <input value="{{namespace}}" required="true" pattern="{{&quot;[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)+&quot;}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="namespace-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="namespace-hint">稳定的点分命名空间，例如 io.elmos.orders</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field generation-field-wide"><text>项目说明</text> <textarea value="{{description}}" required="true" rows="{{9}}" maxLength="{{32_000}}" aria-describedby="description-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="description-hint">最多 32,000 字；可直接写简述，也可在下方导入多种来源。建议保留“实体 / 字段 / 关系 / 规则 / 权限”标记；不要上传凭证、生产数据或无授权客户代码。</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field"><text>核心实体</text> <input value="{{entity}}" required="true" pattern="{{&quot;[a-z][a-z0-9_]{1,62}[a-z0-9]&quot;}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="entity-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="entity-hint">可在描述中继续写“实体: order, customer”和字段定义；默认生成内存 API starter。</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field"><text>审批者标识</text> <input value="{{reviewer}}" required="true" readOnly="{{accountRunner}}" pattern="{{&quot;[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9._:@]|/|-){2,199}&quot;}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="reviewer-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="reviewer-hint">{{accountRunner ? "来自已验证企业账户，不能在请求中覆盖。" : "必须与短期 Runner 凭证绑定的 Actor 完全一致；不填写密钥或邮箱凭证。"}}</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field" htmlFor="generation-persistence"><text>数据配置</text> <view id="generation-persistence" value="{{persistence}}" bindchange="onChange">
  <view value="in-memory">内存 Starter</view>
  <view value="postgresql">PostgreSQL 17.5 生产配置</view>
</view> <text>生产配置生成前向迁移、RLS、恢复与真实集成测试；仅对具备仓库可复现验收证据的单语言目标开放： {{productionProfileLabels}} 。</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field" htmlFor="generation-auth-mode"><text>认证配置</text> <view id="generation-auth-mode" value="{{authMode}}" disabled="{{persistence === &quot;in-memory&quot;}}" bindchange="onChange">
  <view value="none">无认证（仅 Starter）</view>
  <view value="jwt">JWT HS256 + Secret 文件</view>
  <view value="oidc">OIDC + 受控 JWKS 文件</view>
</view> <text>身份必须包含 issuer、audience、subject、tenant_id 与 roles；权限默认拒绝。</text></text>
        <text class="generation-field"><text>租户标识</text> <input value="{{tenantId}}" required="true" readOnly="{{accountRunner}}" pattern="{{accountRunner ? undefined : &quot;[a-z][a-z0-9\\-]{2,62}&quot;}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="tenant-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="tenant-hint">{{accountRunner ? "来自已验证 organization_id；切换租户请使用账户菜单。" : "必须与短期 Runner 凭证绑定的租户完全一致；请求头不能自行切换租户。"}}</text></text>
        <view wx:if="{{accountRunner}}" class="generation-field locked-target">
          <text>账户授权</text>
          <text>企业 OIDC · generation:execute</text>
          <text>访问令牌保存在 HttpOnly Cookie，页面脚本不可读取。</text>
        </view>
        <text wx:else class="generation-field"><text>本地 Runner 令牌</text> <input type="password" value="{{runnerToken}}" minLength="{{24}}" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="runner-token-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="runner-token-hint">仅限本地开发；仅保存在当前页面内存，不写入草稿、日志或生成项目。</text></text>
        <view class="generation-source-studio generation-field-wide" aria-labelledby="generation-source-title">
          <view class="generation-source-heading">
            <view>
              <text class="overline">MULTI-SOURCE INTAKE</text>
              <view id="generation-source-title">导入需求来源</view>
            </view>
            <StatusChip status="{{sourceBundle ? &quot;READY&quot; : &quot;NOT_RUN&quot;}}" compact="true" />
          </view>
          <view>文件和能力模块只作为不可信需求文本读取，不执行其中脚本或指令。在线内容仅允许公网 HTTPS，私网、回环、重定向越界和超限响应会被阻断。</view>
          <view class="generation-source-grid">
            <text class="generation-field"><text>在线 HTML 地址</text> <input type="url" value="{{sourceUrl}}" placeholder="https://example.com/requirements" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="source-url-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="source-url-hint">只读取 HTML 正文；不发送 Cookie、凭证或页面内脚本。</text></text>
            <text class="generation-field"><text>仓库能力模块</text> <input value="{{sourceSkills}}" placeholder="elmos-project-synthesis, b77-container-..." autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="source-skills-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="source-skills-hint">填写精确的能力模块名称，逗号分隔，最多 8 个；导入内容不会被执行。</text></text>
            <text class="generation-field"><text>代码仓库工作区 ID</text> <input value="{{repositoryWorkspaceId}}" placeholder="xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx" autoComplete="off" aria-describedby="source-repository-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="source-repository-hint">从“代码仓库工作区”一键带入；服务端重新校验租户、Actor、完整性和文件摘要。</text></text>
            <text class="generation-field"><text>仓库来源文件（可选）</text> <textarea value="{{repositoryPaths}}" placeholder="{{&quot;README.md\ndocs/requirements.md&quot;}}" rows="{{3}}" aria-describedby="source-repository-paths-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="source-repository-paths-hint">每行一个安全相对路径，最多 8 个；留空时按 README、docs、部署、配置、测试、源码顺序选取。</text></text>
            <text class="generation-field generation-field-wide"><text>上传需求文件</text> <input ref="{{sourceFileInput}}" type="file" multiple="true" accept=".txt,.md,.markdown,.docx,.html,.htm,.pdf,text/plain,text/markdown,text/html,application/pdf,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document" aria-describedby="source-files-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="source-files-hint">支持 TXT / Markdown / Word (.docx) / HTML / PDF；单文件 8 MB、最多 8 个。扫描 PDF 需先 OCR；旧 .doc 请转换为 .docx。</text></text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{sourceFiles.length > 0}}" class="generation-source-pending" aria-label="待解析文件">
            <text wx:for="{{sourceFiles}}" wx:for-item="file" wx:key="file.id" key="{{`${file.name}-${file.size}`}}">{{file.name}} · {{Math.ceil(file.size / 1024)}} KB</text>
            <button type="button" class="button button-ghost compact-button" bindtap="onTap">清空文件</button>
          </view>
          <view class="generation-source-actions">
            <button type="button" class="button button-secondary" disabled="{{sourceBusy || runnerBusy || !runnerCredentialReady}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="{{sourceBusy ? &quot;refresh&quot; : &quot;spark&quot;}}" size="{{14}}" class="{{sourceBusy ? &quot;spinning&quot; : &quot;&quot;}}" />
              <text>{{sourceBusy ? "正在提取与绑定" : "解析并合并来源"}}</text>
            </button>
            <text>来源包与当前租户、审批者和摘要绑定 60 分钟；仓库内容只读取、不执行，合并文本仍需人工审阅。</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{sourceBundle}}" class="generation-source-results" aria-label="已绑定来源">
            <text>{{sourceBundle.sources.length}} 个来源 · {{sourceBundle.bundleSha256.slice(0, 12)}}</text>
            <text wx:for="{{sourceBundle.sources}}" wx:for-item="source" wx:key="source.id" key="{{source.id}}">{{source.id}} · {{source.kind}} · {{source.label}} · {{source.includedCharacters}} / {{source.extractedCharacters}} 字 {{source.truncated ? " · 已截取" : ""}}</text>
            <text wx:for="{{sourceBundle.warnings}}" wx:for-item="warning" wx:key="warning.id" key="{{warning}}">{{warning}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <fieldset class="target-fieldset" aria-describedby="target-hint target-error">
        <legend>
          <text><text class="overline">EXACT TARGETS</text> <text>选择目标技术栈</text></text>
          <text class="step-label">02 / 02</text>
        </legend>
        <view id="target-hint">每个目标都有独立模板、工具链、构建和启动探针；缺失工具只会令该目标保持 NOT_RUN。</view>
        <view class="target-grid">
          <text wx:for="{{availableTargets}}" wx:for-item="profile" wx:key="profile.id" class="{{`target-card target-${profile.accent} ${checked ? &quot;selected&quot; : &quot;&quot;}`}}" key="{{profile.id}}"><input type="checkbox" checked="{{checked}}" disabled="{{persistence === &quot;postgresql&quot; &amp;&amp; profile.productionProfiles.length === 0}}" bindchange="onChange" /> <text class="target-check"><Icon name="check" size="{{13}}" /></text> <text class="target-icon"><Icon name="{{profile.icon}}" size="{{21}}" /></text> <text class="target-copy"><text>{{profile.language}} {{profile.runtime}}</text> <text>{{profile.framework}} · {{profile.maturity}}</text> <text>{{profile.sourceSkill}} · : {{profile.port}} · 生产 {{profile.productionEntityScope === "multi-entity" ? "多实体" : "单实体"}}</text></text></text>
        </view>
        <text class="field-error" id="target-error" role="alert">{{targetError}}</text>
      </fieldset>
      <view class="generation-draft-library" aria-labelledby="generation-drafts-title">
        <view class="generation-section-heading compact">
          <view>
            <text class="overline">LOCAL REVIEW DRAFTS</text>
            <view id="generation-drafts-title">已保存的生成交接</view>
          </view>
          <text>{{savedDrafts.length}} / 50</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{savedDrafts.length === 0}}" class="generation-drafts-empty">提交有效项目意图后，草稿会保存在当前浏览器，刷新页面仍可恢复。</view>
        <view wx:else class="generation-draft-list">
          <view wx:for="{{savedDrafts}}" wx:for-item="saved" wx:key="saved.id" class="{{`generation-draft-row ${draft?.id === saved.id ? &quot;active&quot; : &quot;&quot;}`}}" key="{{saved.id}}">
            <text class="capability-icon accent-cyan"><Icon name="repository" size="{{17}}" /></text>
            <view>
              <text>{{saved.name}}</text>
              <text>{{saved.targets.join(" + ")}} · {{new Date(saved.createdAt).toLocaleString("zh-CN")}}</text>
            </view>
            <StatusChip status="{{draft?.id === saved.id ? &quot;REVIEW&quot; : &quot;DRAFT&quot;}}" compact="true" />
            <button type="button" class="button button-secondary compact-button" aria-label="{{`恢复草稿 ${saved.name}`}}" bindtap="onTap">恢复</button>
            <button type="button" class="icon-button" aria-label="{{`删除草稿 ${saved.name}`}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="close" size="{{13}}" />
            </button>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="planned-assets" aria-labelledby="assets-title">
        <view class="generation-section-heading compact">
          <view>
            <text class="overline">PLANNED ASSETS</text>
            <view id="assets-title">生成计划包含</view>
          </view>
          <text>{{job ? job.status : "实际未生成"}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="asset-grid">
          <view wx:for="{{plannedAssets}}" wx:for-item="asset" wx:key="asset.id" class="asset-item" key="{{asset.title}}">
            <text><Icon name="{{asset.icon}}" size="{{17}}" /></text>
            <view>
              <text>{{asset.title}}</text>
              <text>{{asset.detail}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="generation-analysis" aria-labelledby="generation-analysis-title">
        <view class="generation-section-heading compact">
          <view>
            <text class="overline">REQUIREMENT REVIEW</text>
            <view id="generation-analysis-title">结构化需求审阅</view>
          </view>
          <StatusChip status="{{analysis ? (analysis.request.open_questions.length ? &quot;BLOCKED&quot; : &quot;REVIEW&quot;) : &quot;NOT_RUN&quot;}}" compact="true" />
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{!analysis}}" class="generation-drafts-empty">锁定 Intent 后运行需求分析；批准前必须查看实体、字段、规则、权限和开放问题。</view>
        <view wx:else class="generation-analysis-grid">
          <view class="generation-analysis-card">
            <text>实体与字段 · {{analysis.request.entities.length}}</text>
            <view wx:for="{{analysis.request.entities}}" wx:key="item.id" class="analysis-entity" key="{{item.singular}}">
              <text>{{item.singular}} → {{item.plural}}</text>
              <text>{{item.fields.map((field) => `${field.name}:${field.type}${field.required ? "!" : "?"}`).join(" · ")}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="generation-analysis-card">
            <text>需求与规则</text>
            <text>{{analysis.request.requirements.length}} 项需求 · {{analysis.request.acceptance_criteria.length}} 项验收条件 · {{analysis.request.business_rules.length}} 条业务规则</text>
            <text>审阅摘要 · {{analysis.requestDigest.slice(0, 16)}}</text>
            <text wx:for="{{analysis.request.business_rules}}" wx:for-item="rule" wx:key="rule.id" key="{{rule.id}}">{{rule.id}} · {{rule.statement}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{analysis.request.requirement_sources && analysis.request.source_bundle_sha256}}" class="generation-analysis-card">
            <text>来源证明 · {{analysis.request.requirement_sources.length}}</text>
            <text>来源包 {{analysis.request.source_bundle_sha256.slice(0, 16)}} · 已绑定当前审批摘要</text>
            <text wx:for="{{analysis.request.requirement_sources}}" wx:for-item="source" wx:key="source.id" key="{{source.id}}">{{source.id}} · {{source.kind}} · {{source.label}} · {{source.sha256.slice(0, 12)}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="generation-analysis-card">
            <text>关系与权限</text>
            <text>{{analysis.request.relations.length}} 条关系 · {{analysis.request.permissions.length}} 条声明性权限； {{analysis.request.project.auth_mode === "none"
                      ? "当前无认证，仅用于本地 Starter。"
                      : `当前 ${analysis.request.project.auth_mode.toUpperCase()} 默认拒绝并执行租户/权限契约。`}}</text>
            <text wx:for="{{analysis.request.relations}}" wx:for-item="relation" wx:key="relation.id" key="{{`${relation.source}-${relation.source_field ?? &quot;&quot;}-${relation.target}-${relation.target_field ?? &quot;&quot;}`}}">{{relation.source}} {{relation.source_field ? `.${relation.source_field}` : ""}} {{relation.kind}} {{relation.target}} {{relation.target_field ? `.${relation.target_field}` : ""}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{analysis.request.relations.length === 0}}">当前未声明实体关系</text>
            <text wx:for="{{analysis.request.permissions}}" wx:for-item="permission" wx:key="permission.id" key="{{`${permission.actor}-${permission.action}-${permission.resource}-${permission.effect}`}}">{{permission.actor}} · {{permission.effect}} {{permission.action}} · {{permission.resource}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="{{`generation-analysis-card ${analysis.request.open_questions.length ? &quot;analysis-blocked&quot; : &quot;&quot;}`}}">
            <text>开放问题 · {{analysis.request.open_questions.length}}</text>
            <text wx:for="{{analysis.request.open_questions}}" wx:for-item="question" wx:key="question.id" key="{{question.id}}">{{question.id}} · {{question.question}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{analysis.request.open_questions.length === 0}}">无阻断性开放问题，可以进入显式批准。</text>
            <text wx:if="{{incompatibleProductionTargets.length > 0}}" class="warning-text">目标边界阻断： {{incompatibleProductionTargets.map((target) => target.language).join("、")}} 的 PostgreSQL Profile 当前仍只接受单实体；请改选多实体目标或将需求拆分。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="generation-runner" aria-labelledby="generation-runner-title">
        <view class="generation-section-heading compact">
          <view>
            <text class="overline">GOVERNED LOCAL RUNNER</text>
            <view id="generation-runner-title">执行、验证与一键本地部署运行</view>
          </view>
          <StatusChip status="{{job?.status ?? (runnerReady ? &quot;READY&quot; : runnerReadiness?.status === &quot;BLOCKED&quot; ? &quot;BLOCKED&quot; : &quot;NOT_CONFIGURED&quot;)}}" compact="true" />
        </view>
        <view class="generation-job-recovery">
          <text><text>恢复任务 ID</text> <input value="{{recoveryJobId}}" placeholder="完整任务 UUID" inputMode="text" autoComplete="off" maxLength="{{36}}" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{runnerBusy || !runnerReady || !runnerCredentialReady}}" bindtap="onTap">
            <Icon name="refresh" size="{{15}}" />
            <text>恢复任务</text>
          </button>
          <text>使用当前租户、审批者与重新输入的短期令牌恢复服务端原子持久化任务；浏览器不保存令牌。</text>
        </view>
        <text class="generation-approval"><input type="checkbox" checked="{{approved}}" disabled="{{!draft || !analysis || analysis.request.open_questions.length &gt; 0 || incompatibleProductionTargets.length &gt; 0 || runnerBusy}}" bindchange="onChange" /> <text><text>我已审阅结构化需求，并批准当前 Intent 在本机受控 Runner 中执行</text> <text>只允许固定的 Project Synthesis 子命令；任务失败、重启或工具链缺失时保持 BLOCKED / PARTIAL。</text></text></text>
        <view wx:if="{{job}}" class="generation-job" aria-live="polite">
          <view class="generation-job-summary">
            <view>
              <text>任务</text>
              <text>{{job.id.slice(0, 8)}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>阶段</text>
              <text>{{job.stage}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>结果</text>
              <text>{{job.resultStatus}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>运行</text>
              <text>{{job.runtime.status}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>预览剩余</text>
              <text>{{["STARTING", "RUNNING"].includes(job.runtime.status) ? runtimeCountdown : "--:--"}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>隔离</text>
              <text>{{job.runtime.executor ?? capability?.localRunner.isolation ?? "NOT_CONFIGURED"}}</text>
            </view>
            <view wx:if="{{job.artifactSha256}}">
              <text>归档摘要</text>
              <text>{{job.artifactSha256.slice(0, 12)}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="generation-progress" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="{{job.progress}}" aria-valuemin="{{0}}" aria-valuemax="{{100}}" aria-label="任务进度">
            <text style="{{{ width: `${job.progress}%` }}}" />
          </view>
          <ProjectEvidenceCharts insights="{{job.insights}}" />
          <view wx:if="{{job.reason}}" class="generation-job-reason" role="alert">{{runnerReasonMessage(job.reason)}}</view>
          <pre class="generation-job-logs" tabIndex="{{0}}" aria-label="任务日志">{{job.logs.slice(-60).map((entry) => `[${new Date(entry.at).toLocaleTimeString("zh-CN")}] ${entry.stream}: ${entry.message}`).join("\n") || "等待任务日志…"}}</pre>
          <view wx:if="{{job.artifacts.length > 0}}" class="generation-artifact-tree" aria-label="生成文件树">
            <view>
              <text>生成文件树</text>
              <text>{{job.artifacts.length}} 个内容寻址文件</text>
            </view>
            <view wx:for="{{artifactGroups}}" wx:for-item="[root, artifacts]" wx:key="[root, artifacts].id" key="{{root}}">
              <view>
                <text>{{root}} /</text>
                <text>{{artifacts.length}}</text>
              </view>
              <view>
                <view wx:for="{{artifacts}}" wx:for-item="artifact" wx:key="artifact.id" key="{{artifact.path}}">
                  <code>{{artifact.path}}</code>
                  <text>{{artifact.sha256.slice(0, 12)}}</text>
                </view>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="generation-runtime-controls">
            <text><text>运行目标</text> <view value="{{runtimeLanguage}}" disabled="{{[&quot;STARTING&quot;, &quot;RUNNING&quot;].includes(job.runtime.status)}}" bindchange="onChange">
  <view wx:for="{{job.runtime.plans}}" wx:for-item="plan" wx:key="plan.id" key="{{plan.language}}" value="{{plan.language}}">{{plan.language}} · : {{plan.port}}</view>
</view></text>
            <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{runnerBusy || !runnerCredentialReady || job.runtime.plans.length === 0 || [&quot;STARTING&quot;, &quot;RUNNING&quot;].includes(job.runtime.status)}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="play" size="{{15}}" />
              <text>一键运行 10 分钟</text>
            </button>
            <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{runnerBusy || !runnerCredentialReady || job.runtime.status !== &quot;RUNNING&quot;}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="external" size="{{15}}" />
              <text>浏览器查看运行结果</text>
            </button>
            <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{runnerBusy || !runnerCredentialReady || ![&quot;STARTING&quot;, &quot;RUNNING&quot;].includes(job.runtime.status)}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="close" size="{{15}}" />
              <text>停止</text>
            </button>
            <button class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled="{{!job.artifactReady || !runnerCredentialReady}}" bindtap="onTap">
              <Icon name="file" size="{{15}}" />
              <text>一键下载完整代码库</text>
            </button>
          </view>
          <pre wx:if="{{runtimePreviewPayload !== null}}" class="generation-runtime-preview" aria-label="浏览器运行结果">{{JSON.stringify(runtimePreviewPayload, null, 2)}}</pre>
          <view class="generation-github-publish" aria-labelledby="generation-github-title">
            <view class="generation-section-heading compact">
              <view>
                <text class="overline">GITHUB DELIVERY</text>
                <view id="generation-github-title">一键上传 GitHub 私有仓库</view>
              </view>
              <StatusChip status="{{job.githubPublication?.status ?? &quot;NOT_RUN&quot;}}" compact="true" />
            </view>
            <view>
              <text>只创建新的私有仓库和</text>
              <code>main</code>
              <text>首次提交，不覆盖、强推、合并或部署。生成归档与远端 Tree/Branch 会逐项回读校验。</text>
            </view>
            <view class="generation-github-fields">
              <text><text>GitHub 所有者（可选）</text> <input value="{{githubOwner}}" placeholder="组织名；留空为当前账户" autoComplete="off" maxLength="{{39}}" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
              <text><text>GitHub 仓库名</text> <input value="{{githubRepositoryName}}" autoComplete="off" maxLength="{{100}}" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
              <text class="generation-github-token"><text>GitHub 短期凭证</text> <input type="password" value="{{githubToken}}" autoComplete="off" minLength="{{20}}" maxLength="{{512}}" aria-describedby="github-token-hint" bindchange="onChange" /> <text id="github-token-hint">需要 Administration: write 与 Contents: write；只在本次 HTTPS 请求内存中使用，不写入浏览器存储、任务、日志或代码库。</text></text>
            </view>
            <text class="generation-approval generation-github-confirmation"><input type="checkbox" checked="{{githubConfirmed}}" disabled="{{githubBusy || job.status !== &quot;COMPLETED&quot;}}" bindchange="onChange" /> <text><text>我确认创建新的 GitHub 私有仓库并上传当前摘要绑定的完整代码</text> <text>上传失败时只清理本次新建仓库；清理无法验证会保持 BLOCKED 并要求人工核对。</text></text></text>
            <view class="generation-github-actions">
              <button class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled="{{githubBusy || job.status !== &quot;COMPLETED&quot; || !job.artifactReady || !githubConfirmed || githubToken.trim().length &lt; 20 || (accountRunner &amp;&amp; !accountCanPublish)}}" bindtap="onTap">
                <Icon name="repository" size="{{15}}" />
                <text>{{githubBusy ? "正在创建并校验…" : "一键上传 GitHub"}}</text>
              </button>
              <text wx:if="{{accountRunner && !accountCanPublish}}">当前账户没有 repository:push，服务端会拒绝外部写入。</text>
            </view>
            <view wx:if="{{job.githubPublication?.status === 'PUBLISHED' && job.githubPublication.repositoryUrl}}" class="generation-github-receipt">
              <text>{{job.githubPublication.repositoryFullName}}</text>
              <text>main · {{job.githubPublication.commitSha?.slice(0, 12)}} · {{job.githubPublication.fileCount}} 个文件</text>
              <navigator href="{{job.githubPublication.repositoryUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">在 GitHub 查看</navigator>
            </view>
            <view wx:if="{{job.githubPublication?.status === 'BLOCKED'}}" class="generation-job-reason" role="alert">{{job.githubPublication.reason}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="generation-submit-row">
        <view>
          <Icon name="lock" size="{{16}}" />
          <text><text>显式批准后才允许执行</text> <text>未配置 Runner 时仍可导出 Intent 与 CLI 交接</text></text>
        </view>
        <view class="generation-submit-actions">
          <button wx:if="{{job && !['COMPLETED', 'PARTIAL', 'BLOCKED', 'CANCELLED'].includes(job.status)}}" class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{runnerBusy || !runnerCredentialReady}}" bindtap="onTap">
            <Icon name="close" size="{{16}}" />
            <text>取消任务</text>
          </button>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{!draft}}" bindtap="downloadIntent">
            <Icon name="external" size="{{16}}" />
            <text>导出 Intent</text>
          </button>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">
            <Icon name="spark" size="{{16}}" />
            <text>锁定生成计划</text>
          </button>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{!draft || !runnerReady || !runnerCredentialReady || runnerBusy}}" bindtap="onTap">
            <Icon name="workflow" size="{{16}}" />
            <text>分析并整理需求</text>
          </button>
          <button class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled="{{!draft || !analysis || analysis.request.open_questions.length &gt; 0 || !approved || !runnerReady || !runnerCredentialReady || runnerBusy}}" bindtap="onTap">
            <Icon name="play" size="{{16}}" />
            <text>一键生成、验证并归档</text>
          </button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </form>
    <view class="generation-preview" aria-label="生成计划预览">
      <view class="generation-preview-hero">
        <view class="preview-status-row">
          <text class="overline">GOVERNED PLAN PREVIEW</text>
          <StatusChip status="{{draft ? &quot;REVIEW&quot; : &quot;DRAFT&quot;}}" compact="true" />
        </view>
        <text class="preview-project-icon"><Icon name="repository" size="{{24}}" /></text>
        <view>{{preview.name || "未命名项目"}}</view>
        <view>{{preview.description || "填写项目说明后，这里会显示生成计划摘要。"}}</view>
        <view class="preview-tags">
          <text>{{preview.entity || "未指定实体"}}</text>
          <text>{{preview.namespace || "未指定命名空间"}}</text>
          <text>{{preview.reviewer || "未指定审批者"}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="preview-section">
        <view class="preview-section-title">
          <text>目标输出</text>
          <text>{{previewProfiles.length}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="preview-target-list">
          <view wx:for="{{previewProfiles}}" wx:for-item="profile" wx:key="profile.id" key="{{profile.id}}">
            <text class="{{`mini-target target-${profile.accent}`}}"><Icon name="{{profile.icon}}" size="{{15}}" /></text>
            <text><text>{{profile.language}} {{profile.runtime}}</text> <text>{{profile.framework}} · {{profile.verificationStatus}}</text></text>
            <text>: {{profile.port}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{previewProfiles.length === 0}}" class="preview-empty">尚未选择目标技术栈。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="preview-section pipeline-section">
        <view class="preview-section-title">
          <text>受控生成阶段</text>
          <text>{{generationStages.length}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="generation-pipeline">
          <view wx:for="{{generationStages}}" wx:for-item="phase" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="phase.id" key="{{phase.batch}}">
            <text>{{index + 1}}</text>
            <text><text>{{phase.title}}</text> <text>{{phase.batch}} · {{phase.detail}}</text></text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="preview-command">
        <view>
          <text>完整 CLI 交接</text>
          <button type="button" disabled="{{!draft}}" bindtap="onTap">
            <Icon name="copy" size="{{13}}" />
            <text>复制全部</text>
          </button>
        </view>
        <view class="workflow-command-list">
          <view wx:for="{{workflowCommands}}" wx:key="item.id" class="workflow-command-item" key="{{item.id}}">
            <view>
              <text>{{item.label}}</text>
              <button type="button" disabled="{{!draft}}" aria-label="{{`复制${item.label}命令`}}" bindtap="onTap">
                <Icon name="copy" size="{{12}}" />
                <text>复制</text>
              </button>
            </view>
            <code>{{item.command}}</code>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text>{{draft ? "先导出 project-intent.json；命令与 Project Synthesis 1.2.0 引擎契约对应，任何一步失败都应停止。" : "先提交有效表单以锁定 Intent 和命令，防止复制仍在变化的未审阅输入。"}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="generation-boundary">
        <Icon name="shield" size="{{19}}" />
        <view>
          <text>证据边界保持关闭</text>
          <text>数据库迁移、身份/租户执行、监控、备份恢复与隔离运行配置已生成；真实云部署、恢复演练、人工辅助技术验收、独立用户验收和外部认证仍是 NOT_RUN。</text>
        </view>
        <StatusChip status="NOT_CERTIFIED" compact="true" />
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <RuntimeDeploymentGuide id="generation-runtime-deployment" guidance="{{deploymentGuidance}}" selectedTargets="{{preview.targets}}" />
  <view class="{{`feedback-toast ${feedback ? &quot;visible&quot; : &quot;&quot;}`}}" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
    <text><Icon name="check" size="{{17}}" /></text>
    <text>{{feedback}}</text>
  </view>
</view>
